  - m_Id: 1143582744
    m_Localized: Play the tutorial? It takes a few minutes and ends at the shelter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582745
    m_Localized: Shelter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582746
    m_Localized: Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582747
    m_Localized: Raid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582748
    m_Localized: Main Menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582749
    m_Localized: LOADING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582750
    m_Localized: You Died
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582751
    m_Localized: You lost everything you were carrying. You woke up in the shelter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582752
    m_Localized: Return to Shelter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582753
    m_Localized: Return to the shelter?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582754
    m_Localized: You will leave the raid and keep everything in your backpack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582755
    m_Localized: Return
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582756
    m_Localized: Stay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582757
    m_Localized: Extract
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582758
    m_Localized: "Stage 1 of 3 \xB7 Search the Room"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582759
    m_Localized: 'WASD to move, Shift to sprint, mouse to aim.

      You''re hurt
      and hungry. Search the furniture (E) for food and bandages.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582760
    m_Localized: Search cabinets and drawers (E) for food and bandages
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582761
    m_Localized: Open inventory (I), point at food, and press F to eat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582762
    m_Localized: Use bandages the same way (F)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582763
    m_Localized: "Stage 2 of 3 \xB7 Enemies"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582764
    m_Localized: Drifters are ahead. Hold Ctrl to crouch. They won't hear your steps
      and can only spot you up close. Stay out of their line of sight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582765
    m_Localized: Crouch (Ctrl) and sneak behind the Drifter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582766
    m_Localized: Pick up the mug (E)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582767
    m_Localized: Distract the second one. Hold G, aim, and throw the mug
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582768
    m_Localized: Get to the exit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582769
    m_Localized: "Stage 3 of 3 \xB7 The Environment"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582770
    m_Localized: Drink at the water cooler and use the restroom. Ignoring your needs
      slows you down and makes it easier for enemies to smell you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582771
    m_Localized: Drink from the cooler (hold E)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582772
    m_Localized: Use the restroom (hold E)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582773
    m_Localized: Crawl through the opening (hold E)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582774
    m_Localized: Climb over the barricade (Space)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582775
    m_Localized: Find the key in the drawers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582776
    m_Localized: Unlock the door and leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582777
    m_Localized: You made it! Pick up the mug (E). Throwing things makes noise that
      attracts enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582778
    m_Localized: 'The second Drifter is guarding the exit. Stay crouched, hold G,
      and throw the mug into the upper corner near him.

      When he investigates,
      sneak to the exit along the bottom.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582779
    m_Localized: A barricade blocks the way. Walk up to it and press Space to climb
      over. Climbing uses stamina.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582780
    m_Localized: The exit is locked. Search the drawers for the key.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582781
    m_Localized: Good work! The door to the next room is open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582782
    m_Localized: Tutorial Complete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582783
    m_Localized: 'Next stop: the shelter. Rest, trade, and gear up for a raid. You''ll
      keep everything you''re carrying.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582784
    m_Localized: You kept your gear. The tutorial will restart from the beginning
      of this stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582785
    m_Localized: Try Again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582786
    m_Localized: Skip the tutorial?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1143582787
    m_Localized: You'll go straight to the shelter and keep everything you're carrying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
