    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302756
    m_Localized: Get Me Out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302757
    m_Localized: Something in the Garage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302758
    m_Localized: Filing Supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302759
    m_Localized: Coffee for the Survivors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302760
    m_Localized: Paperwork
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302761
    m_Localized: Garage Recon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302762
    m_Localized: Books for Kindling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302763
    m_Localized: Restroom Patrol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302764
    m_Localized: Paper Press
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302765
    m_Localized: Paper Press
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302766
    m_Localized: Mugs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302767
    m_Localized: Crooked Vending Machines
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302768
    m_Localized: Why are you whispering?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302769
    m_Localized: I've got to go
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302770
    m_Localized: How can I help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302771
    m_Localized: Come with me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302772
    m_Localized: Stay here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302773
    m_Localized: Let's trade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302774
    m_Localized: Got any work?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302775
    m_Localized: How do you like it here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302776
    m_Localized: What's new?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302777
    m_Localized: To the offices
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302778
    m_Localized: To the break room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302779
    m_Localized: To the manager's office
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302780
    m_Localized: To the restroom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302781
    m_Localized: To the parking garage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302782
    m_Localized: To storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302783
    m_Localized: To the copy room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302784
    m_Localized: I don't know yet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302785
    m_Localized: "If it's not too much trouble\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302786
    m_Localized: Really? Thanks!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302787
    m_Localized: You got it? You're the best.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302788
    m_Localized: Well? How's it coming along?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302789
    m_Localized: I've got a couple of jobs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302790
    m_Localized: It's a deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302791
    m_Localized: I see you've got everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302792
    m_Localized: "Two mugs, [\u0418\u0413\u0420\u041E\u041A]."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302793
    m_Localized: I'll do it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302794
    m_Localized: "I'll do it. One more thing\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302795
    m_Localized: See you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302796
    m_Localized: Not now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302797
    m_Localized: Here you go
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302798
    m_Localized: Later
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302799
    m_Localized: Abandon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302800
    m_Localized: Yes, abandon it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302801
    m_Localized: No, I'll finish it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302802
    m_Localized: Got any work for me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302803
    m_Localized: "No work right now, [\u0418\u0413\u0420\u041E\u041A]. Check back
      later."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302804
    m_Localized: You aren't working on anything for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302805
    m_Localized: You haven't finished yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302806
    m_Localized: Make room for your reward and come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302807
    m_Localized: Giving up? Fine. I'll remember that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302808
    m_Localized: Fine. I'll find someone else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302809
    m_Localized: "About your job\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302810
    m_Localized: 'New Job: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302811
    m_Localized: 'Turn In: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302812
    m_Localized: 'Marked: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302813
    m_Localized: 'Reward: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302814
    m_Localized: "skill \u201C{0}\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302815
    m_Localized: "blueprint \u201C{0}\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302816
    m_Localized: Shake Vending Machines
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302817
    m_Localized: I barely know you. Help me out first and then we'll talk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302818
    m_Localized: Can't do that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302819
    m_Localized: 'Too heavy: that''s another {0:0.#} kg. Drop some gear first.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302820
    m_Localized: "You'll need {0}\xD7{1} spaces in your backpack or free hands."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302821
    m_Localized: "Shh! Keep it down\u2026 Are you alive? For real?\n\nI'm Vitya,
      an intern in accounting. I went to hand in a report and got lost. That was
      a long time ago."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302822
    m_Localized: 'Something''s walking around by the garage. I saw it. It wasn''t
      human.


      I ran so fast I dropped all my notes. Now I''m sitting here
      trying not to breathe.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302823
    m_Localized: Leave? I can't. I'm so weak I can barely take a step. Help me get
      back on my feet first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302824
    m_Localized: 'I don''t know. It was tall. It stands still as long as you look
      at it.


      Help me get back on my feet and then we''ll see.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302825
    m_Localized: You came back! I thought something had eaten you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302826
    m_Localized: 'At least there are chairs here. And nothing''s walking around behind
      the wall.


      If you need anything, I''ve got some office supplies lying
      around.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302827
    m_Localized: 'It''s quiet here. Sometimes I dream about the maze.


      They
      say I can show you something when you build a workshop. I can do more than
      write reports, you know.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302828
    m_Localized: "Hey, [\u0418\u0413\u0420\u041E\u041A]! I always keep the good stuff
      for my people."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302829
    m_Localized: "Hey, [\u0418\u0413\u0420\u041E\u041A]. Sit down and see what I've
      got. If you have something to sell, I'll pay a fair price."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302830
    m_Localized: 'Word is there''s someone alive in the maze. An accounting intern,
      if the rumors are true.


      I don''t know how he ended up there, but I
      doubt he''ll get out on his own.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302831
    m_Localized: Depends where you're headed. Go on, tell me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302832
    m_Localized: Same everywhere. Keep quiet, don't play hero, and watch your step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302833
    m_Localized: Brews one coffee per raid using one water and one serving of beans.
      A batch makes three cups. The tank holds three waters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302834
    m_Localized: Turns one stack of books into five packs of paper. Load the books
      and the paper will be ready when you return from a raid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302835
    m_Localized: Get me out of here, will you? I won't make it on my own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302836
    m_Localized: "Walls\u2026 Real walls. Thanks, [\u0418\u0413\u0420\u041E\u041A].\n\nTake
      my briefcase. I don't need it anymore. The report's long gone anyway."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302837
    m_Localized: A mug. I need a mug. I'll lose my mind without coffee. There isn't
      any here, but at least I can hold the mug.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302838
    m_Localized: "Thanks\u2026 I feel better already, even without coffee.\n\nListen,
      will you get me out of here? I can stand up now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302839
    m_Localized: I ran so fast I dropped all my notes. Bring them back so I can reconstruct
      the report.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302840
    m_Localized: Great. Now I'm almost a useful employee.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302841
    m_Localized: You asked what I saw by the garage. Go take a look and come straight
      back. I need to know I didn't imagine it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302842
    m_Localized: So it's there. I wasn't imagining things. Thanks for checking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302843
    m_Localized: I want to organize the shelter. Bring me two packs of folders.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302844
    m_Localized: Now this looks like a proper office.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302845
    m_Localized: 'We''ve got a mug and four walls, but still no coffee. We can''t
      live like this.


      I''ve sketched a coffee machine. Bring two mugs, two
      bottles of water, and three packs of paper so I can test the water feed and
      finish the design. I''ll give you the blueprint and enough beans for the first
      three cups.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302846
    m_Localized: Two mugs, two waters, and three packs of paper. The blueprint's
      nearly done. Look for beans in break rooms and storage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302847
    m_Localized: 'It works! On paper, anyway. Here''s the blueprint and the beans.


      Build
      the coffee machine in an open module slot. Add water and a batch of beans for
      three uses. It brews one cup per raid as long as it has water and beans.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302848
    m_Localized: "Let's start simple, [\u0418\u0413\u0420\u041E\u041A]. I need ordinary
      office paper. It's all over the raid, in offices and by the copiers.\n\nBring
      me three packs and I'll pay you. Yes, for paper. Don't ask."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302849
    m_Localized: "Paper, [\u0418\u0413\u0420\u041E\u041A]. Three packs. They won't
      walk here on their own."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302850
    m_Localized: 'That''s what I''m talking about. Here''s what we agreed on.


      Come
      back later. I''ve got a bigger job for you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302851
    m_Localized: 'There''s a red folder in the manager''s office. What''s inside
      is none of your business. Or mine, honestly.


      Bring it back. You''ll
      know the office by the smell of power and expensive coffee.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302852
    m_Localized: The red folder from the manager's office. It's the only one like
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302853
    m_Localized: "That's the one. Not even bent. A pleasure doing business with you,
      [\u0418\u0413\u0420\u041E\u041A]."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302854
    m_Localized: "They say someone left a car running in the garage. It's been three
      years.\n\nSee for yourself and come back alive, [\u0418\u0413\u0420\u041E\u041A].
      Dead people are terrible storytellers."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302855
    m_Localized: The parking garage. Get there, take a look, and come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302856
    m_Localized: So it's still there. All right. Here's something for your trouble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302857
    m_Localized: It's getting colder. Bring me two stacks of books. Nobody's going
      to read them anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302858
    m_Localized: They burn well. I mean, they're good books.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302859
    m_Localized: "We're out of paper again. Five packs, [\u0418\u0413\u0420\u041E\u041A],
      and we're square for today."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302860
    m_Localized: Check the restroom in the maze today. Make sure everything's as
      usual, then come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302861
    m_Localized: 'Everyone needs paper and nobody reads books. I saw a press at a
      print shop once. Books went in and paper came out.


      Bring three stacks
      of books for a trial run. I''ll draw up a blueprint.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302862
    m_Localized: "Three stacks of books, [\u0418\u0413\u0420\u041E\u041A]. I can't
      draw up anything without them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302863
    m_Localized: Here's the blueprint. Build it at the shelter with folders, a mop,
      and a couple of coins. Don't ask how. Just build it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302864
    m_Localized: I keep breaking dishes. Don't ask how. Bring me two mugs. Any will
      do, as long as they're intact.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302865
    m_Localized: 'The machines in the break rooms eat coins and keep half the goods.
      But there''s a way to make them cooperate.


      Bring me five coins and
      I''ll show you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302866
    m_Localized: "Five coins, [\u0418\u0413\u0420\u041E\u041A]. Then we'll talk."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302867
    m_Localized: Hit it on the side, right here, and shake. Keep it short and quiet
      or they'll come running.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302868
    m_Localized: "\u2022 Thirst slows healing. Hunger drains stamina.\n\u2022 Approach
      the water cooler and hold E to drink. You'll need the restroom soon enough.\n\u2022
      If you wait too long, you'll slow down and enemies will pick up your scent.
      Hold E at the toilet.\n\u2022 The corridor ends here, but there's an opening
      in the wall to the right. Hold E near it to crawl through."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302869
    m_Localized: "If you're reading this, you're awake. The building is crawling
      with Drifters, but it's quiet here for now.\n\n\u2022 WASD to move, Shift to
      sprint (uses stamina).\n\u2022 E to search furniture or pick up items. I opens
      the inventory.\n\u2022 In the inventory, point at food and press F to eat.
      Right-click to hold an item, then hold left-click to use it.\n\nYou're hurt
      and hunger drains your stamina. Find food and bandages."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 821654302870
    m_Localized: "Drifters are weak alone, but they call for help.\n\n\u2022 Hold
      Ctrl to crouch. Your steps are silent and enemies can only see you up close.\n\u2022
      Walking can be heard nearby. Running carries farther.\n\u2022 Stay out of their
      sight. They look ahead, not behind.\n\u2022 A picked-up item is selected in
      the inventory. Hold G, aim, and release to throw it. Enemies will investigate
      the noise."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
