    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879902
    m_Localized: "Split {0} of {1} ({2} left). Mouse wheel or +/\u2212 to adjust,
      Enter to confirm"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879903
    m_Localized: You can't put a person here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879904
    m_Localized: Drag to move, R to rotate, Ctrl+click to split. Right-click or Shift+click
      to transfer. Drag gear in or out of a slot. Heavy items need both hands. Double-click
      to equip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879905
    m_Localized: 'Can''t equip: too heavy'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879906
    m_Localized: '{0}: empty. Drag an item here to hold it'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879907
    m_Localized: '{0}: empty. Drag gear here or double-click to equip'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879908
    m_Localized: '{0}: {1}{2}. Right-click or Shift+click to transfer, or drag to
      move it'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
