  - m_Id: 2013100879912
    m_Localized: 'Can''t put it here: no space or too heavy'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879913
    m_Localized: No room to put away your held items
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879914
    m_Localized: 'Can''t hold: too heavy'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879915
    m_Localized: 'Can''t put it here: space occupied'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879916
    m_Localized: This stack has only one item
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879917
    m_Localized: "{0} \xD7{1}: how many?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879918
    m_Localized: Only {0} fit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879919
    m_Localized: 'Can''t split: no free space'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879920
    m_Localized: '{0:0.#} / {1:0.#} kg'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879921
    m_Localized: '{0:0.#} kg'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879922
    m_Localized: Not discovered yet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879923
    m_Localized: . Double-click to equip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879924
    m_Localized: ${0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879925
    m_Localized: Forget the notes. Let's go
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879926
    m_Localized: What did you see by the garage?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879927
    m_Localized: "About your request\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879928
    m_Localized: Any advice before I head out?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879929
    m_Localized: Office supplies! Almost none of it stolen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879930
    m_Localized: Hiking Backpack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879931
    m_Localized: Paper Press
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879932
    m_Localized: "Nothing right now. Thanks for asking, [\u0418\u0413\u0420\u041E\u041A]."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879933
    m_Localized: I'll wait. I'm used to waiting here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879934
    m_Localized: You've got nowhere to put it. Make some space. I'm not going anywhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879935
    m_Localized: "Two stacks of books, [\u0418\u0413\u0420\u041E\u041A]."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879936
    m_Localized: Paper for Today
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879937
    m_Localized: Five packs of paper. Today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879938
    m_Localized: Good. That'll last until tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879939
    m_Localized: The restroom. Take a look and come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879940
    m_Localized: Same as usual? Good. Here you go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879941
    m_Localized: They're intact. Great. Here's your money.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2013100879942
    m_Localized: Eat and bandage your wounds first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
